    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a blogger traveling around Moscow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the most stunning photos, grow your follower count, and discover new travel spots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;In the Lens!&quot;</i> is a fun and educational adventure for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with humor, exciting quests, and mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story, you play as a girl who has come to Moscow to become a travel blogger. Your main task is photography: snapping pictures of landmarks, events, and interesting people. As your photos gain attention, your blog grows, and so does your follower count! However, you\u2019ll soon notice something strange happening around you\u2014you\u2019ll need to help characters by completing various tasks (many of which include mini-games!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two main locations: <strong>Red Square</strong> and <strong>Gorky Park</strong>, both packed with unique quests and plenty of picturesque landmarks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your smartphone will be your main companion on this adventure\u2014it\u2019s equipped with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A regular and selfie camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A notebook with your current tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inventory where you can read about collected items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A social network with your personal blog, where your photos are posted and your follower count rises!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/f9bc5dcb38a6d460d1e95b4e992ff298.avif?t=1753384518\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/860176629afa94e78d5ebc85d6b7f5c3.avif?t=1753384518\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/2b00bf0377b676d93881dd8307078dcb.avif?t=1753384518\" width=462 height=693 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/61bd0768e97fa73fab1dc744e57719e2.avif?t=1753384518\" width=468 height=694 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/589615bd9ad4881501b7859c177a90a0.avif?t=1753384518\" width=445 height=685 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/99cd9e462bb8ff81af989d5d7f5f7b3c.avif?t=1753384518\" width=446 height=684 /></span><br><br>The game is designed for about <strong>4 hours of gameplay</strong>, so don\u2019t wait\u2014dive into this exciting journey through Moscow!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a blogger traveling around Moscow.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture the most stunning photos, grow your follower count, and discover new travel spots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;In the Lens!&quot;</i> is a fun and educational adventure for all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with humor, exciting quests, and mini-games!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the story, you play as a girl who has come to Moscow to become a travel blogger. Your main task is photography: snapping pictures of landmarks, events, and interesting people. As your photos gain attention, your blog grows, and so does your follower count! However, you\u2019ll soon notice something strange happening around you\u2014you\u2019ll need to help characters by completing various tasks (many of which include mini-games!).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features two main locations: <strong>Red Square</strong> and <strong>Gorky Park</strong>, both packed with unique quests and plenty of picturesque landmarks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your smartphone will be your main companion on this adventure\u2014it\u2019s equipped with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A regular and selfie camera</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A notebook with your current tasks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An inventory where you can read about collected items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A social network with your personal blog, where your photos are posted and your follower count rises!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/f9bc5dcb38a6d460d1e95b4e992ff298.avif?t=1753384518\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/860176629afa94e78d5ebc85d6b7f5c3.avif?t=1753384518\" width=800 height=450 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/2b00bf0377b676d93881dd8307078dcb.avif?t=1753384518\" width=462 height=693 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/61bd0768e97fa73fab1dc744e57719e2.avif?t=1753384518\" width=468 height=694 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/589615bd9ad4881501b7859c177a90a0.avif?t=1753384518\" width=445 height=685 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3658080/extras/99cd9e462bb8ff81af989d5d7f5f7b3c.avif?t=1753384518\" width=446 height=684 /></span><br><br>The game is designed for about <strong>4 hours of gameplay</strong>, so don\u2019t wait\u2014dive into this exciting journey through Moscow!</p>",
